      "start_seconds": 1.31,
      "end_seconds": 4.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Hello come in. Mind the step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.55,
      "end_seconds": 6.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "hi thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.43,
      "end_seconds": 10.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.6,
      "end_seconds": 16.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Doctor, it's watery diarrhoea. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.1,
      "end_seconds": 21.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.98,
      "end_seconds": 34.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.83,
      "end_seconds": 67.74,
      "duration_seconds": 15.91,
      "text": "Okay: weight 71 kilos, blood pressure 111 over 80. And And BMI works out to 27.7, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, heart rate 94, height 160 centimetres, temperature is 38.1 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.1,
      "end_seconds": 82.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.18,
      "end_seconds": 96.1,
      "duration_seconds": 12.92,
      "text": "it's been three days now i didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back i did try to ignore it for a while"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.54,
      "end_seconds": 103.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.38,
      "end_seconds": 120.71,
      "duration_seconds": 16.33,
      "text": "Fasting helps a bit. Pretty mild, if I'm being honest. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.74,
      "end_seconds": 124.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Alright any confusion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.73,
      "end_seconds": 127.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "no confusion, thankfully"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.92,
      "end_seconds": 134.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Have you had any dizziness, blood in the stool or severe abdominal pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.56,
      "end_seconds": 138.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "no, none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.8,
      "end_seconds": 142.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.08,
      "end_seconds": 145.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "no nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.29,
      "end_seconds": 151.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "so, any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.98,
      "end_seconds": 154.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.59,
      "end_seconds": 173.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Okay has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.69,
      "end_seconds": 178.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "no not that I know of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.34,
      "end_seconds": 183.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.59,
      "end_seconds": 196.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.47,
      "text": "I swim twice a week. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.41,
      "end_seconds": 210.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.92,
      "end_seconds": 223.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "Losartan. I take it 50 milligrams, once a day. ORS, after each loose stool"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.58,
      "end_seconds": 229.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.95,
      "end_seconds": 237.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for nearly five years i told my wife I'd come today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.04,
      "end_seconds": 245.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "yes, high blood pressure is known to us, good to have that that clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.61,
      "end_seconds": 252.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "let me look at the area, I'll be gentle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.89,
      "end_seconds": 255.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.49,
      "end_seconds": 274.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "Your mouth is a bit dry and your tummy is soft with mild tenderness all over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.46,
      "end_seconds": 281.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "All finished thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.26,
      "end_seconds": 322.52,
      "duration_seconds": 32.26,
      "text": "Putting it all together I don't have a clear answer today: infective gastroenteritis, likely after recent travel is possible and so is food poisoning. I think a stool test makes sense here for diarrhoea. Small sips often are better than large drinks and eat plain food as soon as you can. I'd like you back after the stool result. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.5,
      "end_seconds": 327.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "good, thanks, I'll see you then"
    }
  ]
}